  "details": "Thank you very much for your continued efforts in developing and operating the service.\n\nCurrently, Join/Leave/Portal notifications appear at the bottom of the screen, but users are not able to change how long they remain visible.\n\nPersonally, I often feel that the duration is too short, while others may find it too long.\n\nFor this reason, I believe it would be more user-friendly if the duration could be specified in seconds—just like how the display time of the Chatbox can be configured in the settings.\n\nI would greatly appreciate your consideration of this request. Thank you very much in advance.",
